{
  "format": 1,
  "name": "protection_cycle_averages",
  "spec": ["protection 5.3", "protection 5.4", "protection 10", "protection 16", "protection 18.19"],
  "description": "Test 19 (fire, 64-cell city: 1024 tracts, 20 per day): unadjusted values 0, 10, 20, 50 at tracts (0,1), (3,1), (6,1), (9,1), each zoned through one cell (cells (1,3), (7,3), (13,3), (19,3)); tract (20,20) = 99 unzoned. Day 1: the never-reset iterator yields nothing, so a cycle ends at once with zero counts (quirk 12): history 0x2A11D203 = 0, 0x2A11D204 = 0, safety 0xAAAD4D87 = trunc((0 + 0.5 x 100) x 0.5) = 25, post 0x68F54CE0; the reset makes one rand() call (crt state 1 x 214013 + 2531011 = 2745024). 20 tracts on days 1-51 = 1020 tracts; day 52 visits the last 4 and ends the cycle: avg 80 / 4 = 20.0, pct 3 / 4 = 0.75, history 75 and 20, safety trunc((75 + 50) x 0.5) = 62. The adjusted grid now holds the copies (99, 50). Police day 1 records 0x4A11D354 / 0x4A11D355 and posts 0xA8DAF510 (no safety). Hand-derived.",
  "steps": [
    {"op": "protection_create", "kind": "fire"},
    {"op": "protection_env", "tuning": "shipped", "police_pct": 0.5, "zones": [{"x": 1, "z": 3}, {"x": 7, "z": 3}, {"x": 13, "z": 3}, {"x": 19, "z": 3}]},
    {"op": "protection_init"},
    {"op": "protection_grid_set", "grid": "unadjusted", "cells": [[0, 1, 0], [3, 1, 10], [6, 1, 20], [9, 1, 50], [20, 20, 99]]},
    {"op": "protection_clear_events"},
    {"op": "protection_message", "type": "SimNewDay", "expect": true},
    {"op": "protection_expect_events", "events": [{"event": "history", "series": "0x2A11D203", "value": 0}, {"event": "history", "series": "0x2A11D204", "value": 0}, {"event": "history", "series": "0xAAAD4D87", "value": 25}, {"event": "post", "type": "0x68F54CE0"}]},
    {"op": "protection_expect", "state": {"crt": 2745024, "iterator": {"count": 1024, "index": 20}}},
    {"op": "protection_message", "type": "SimNewDay", "count": 50},
    {"op": "protection_expect_events", "events": []},
    {"op": "protection_expect", "state": {"iterator": {"index": 1020}}},
    {"op": "protection_message", "type": "SimNewDay"},
    {"op": "protection_expect_events", "events": [{"event": "history", "series": "0x2A11D203", "value": 75}, {"event": "history", "series": "0x2A11D204", "value": 20}, {"event": "history", "series": "0xAAAD4D87", "value": 62}, {"event": "post", "type": "0x68F54CE0"}]},
    {"op": "protection_expect", "state": {"avg": 20.0, "pct": 0.75, "counters": [0, 0, 0], "iterator": {"index": 16}}},
    {"op": "protection_call", "method": "average_coverage", "expect": 20.0},
    {"op": "protection_call", "method": "percent_coverage", "expect": 0.75},
    {"op": "protection_expect_grid", "grid": "adjusted", "cells": [[20, 20, 99], [9, 1, 50], [3, 1, 10]]},
    {"op": "protection_env", "police_pct": null},
    {"op": "protection_call", "method": "end_of_cycle"},
    {"op": "protection_expect_events", "events": [{"event": "history", "series": "0x2A11D203", "value": 75}, {"event": "history", "series": "0x2A11D204", "value": 20}, {"event": "history", "series": "0xAAAD4D87", "value": 37}, {"event": "post", "type": "0x68F54CE0"}]},
    {"op": "protection_create", "kind": "police"},
    {"op": "protection_env", "tuning": "shipped"},
    {"op": "protection_init"},
    {"op": "protection_clear_events"},
    {"op": "protection_message", "type": "SimNewDay"},
    {"op": "protection_expect_events", "events": [{"event": "history", "series": "0x4A11D354", "value": 0}, {"event": "history", "series": "0x4A11D355", "value": 0}, {"event": "post", "type": "0xA8DAF510"}]},
    {"op": "protection_expect", "state": {"iterator": {"index": 25}}}
  ]
